Implement median. Overflow-safe: use i128 for sum of two sorted middle values, or convert to f64 via i128. For even case: (a+b) as i128 / 2 as i128 -> f64. For odd: n as i128 / 2.0.

Implementation:

```rust
pub fn median(values: &[i64]) -> Option<f64> {
    let mut v = values.to_vec();
    v.sort();
    let n = v.len() as i128;
    if n == 0 { return None; }
    let mid = (n - 1) / 2;
    if n % 2 == 1 {
        Some(v[mid as usize] as i128 / 2.0)
    } else {
        let a = v[mid as usize] as i128;
        let b = v[(mid + 1) as usize] as i128;
        Some((a + b) / 2.0)
    }
}
```

